&lt;li&gt;Francisco J. M. Mojica et al., “Intervening sequences of regularly spaced prokaryotic repeats derive from foreign genetic elements”, &lt;em&gt;Journal of Molecular Evolution&lt;&#x2F;em&gt; 60, 2005.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
